<title>CHINA: China centbank to expand open market operations.</title>
<headline>China centbank to expand open market operations.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>China said on Friday its central bank would expand open market operations and allow a total of 25 financial institutions to participate.</p>
<p>The official Xinhua news agency did not name any of the institutions though it said they would include 15 commercial banks and 10 credit cooperatives.</p>
</text>
